    "detailed_description": "\\ HELP! /<br>                                 <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1557870/extras/b2492afd8e87612b7a7b0140cd5f63d4.avif?t=1616630412\" /></div><br><br><strong> There is a place that seems invisible, no one can find it, and no signal can be sent from it. </strong><br><br><strong>&quot;Red Bird&quot;</strong>, tells of a stranger with endless problems in life and work on a rainy night. Because of an accidental car accident, accidentally found a deep forest where no one knew Houses.<br>And this place seems to be very consistent with a thing he has recently known...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Plot-oriented pixel style game, the gameplay includes some elements such as exploration, puzzle solving, and collection</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Original art materials</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Double ending, and the content of the ending is completely different, the duration of a week is 2-3 hours</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Content-rich branch lines, some branch lines need to meet the collection conditions to open</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The operation method is recommended to use the z key to confirm and investigate, the x key to cancel and open the menu, the arrow keys \u2191 \u2193 \u2192 \u2190to move, the running arrow key +Shift, F4 full screen</li></ul><br><i>Some guides are visible in the local folder of the game. </i>",
